cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Computed but not consulted: a self-audit of a generative
  drug-discovery campaign against KRAS in pancreatic cancer
message: If you use this software, data or analysis, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Obi
    given-names: Ebuka David
    affiliation: Autogon Inc.
    email: davidobi023@gmail.com
repository-code: https://github.com/eobi/pancreatic_cancer_research
abstract: >-
  A validated computational pipeline for small-molecule discovery against KRAS in
  pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma, together with a self-audit of a prior generative
  campaign whose three synthesis candidates could not be made. Every stage carries a
  known-answer gate that must reproduce results for approved drugs before its output
  is used. Includes four validated KRAS targets (G12C, G12D, G12V, G12R), three
  completed virtual screens over 518,662 purchasable compounds, MM-GBSA rescoring,
  a filter battery across 240,214 molecules from eight published generative models,
  and all negative results.
